mapping "W3288.1" source="W3288" target="218082000" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W3288 (Swedish ICD-10-SE) = SNOMED CT 218082000 (Handgun discharge - other specified place -
        other specified activity). It is a national 6-char extension subdividing parent ICD-10 W32
        (Handgun discharge) by place and activity. Target SNOMED CT 433948 = (concept_code 218082000), the
        OMOP standard target of W32 in the Athena ICD10 relationships mirror. Target fully subsumes the
        source: every clinical meaning of the SE subcode is contained in the parent handgun-discharge
        concept; the SE code merely adds place/activity detail. High tier : verified Athena crosswalk on
        the parent, one-level broader, well-understood subdivision.
        """
}
