    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W3289 = SNOMED CT 218082000 (Handgun discharge - other specified place - unspecified
        activity). National extension of ICD-10 W32. Target SNOMED CT 433948 = (218082000), the standard
        target of W32. Target subsumes source; the SE subcode only adds place/activity context. High
        tier : parent crosswalk verified in Athena mirror, one-level broader.
        """
}
